359	/**
360	 * Place an order: validate, charge the wallet (unless a free admin grant),
361	 * create the Server + PROVISION job. Returns the new server id. Does NOT
362	 * redirect. Callers must ensure funds exist (or pass free) — this still
363	 * enforces balance and throws OrderError("Insufficient balance.") otherwise.
364	 *
365	 * `sold` overrides the recomputed price with the one the order was actually SOLD
366	 * at — the card-paid path passes the figure stamped on the Checkout session
367	 * BEFORE the card was charged, so the confirm redirect settles the price the
368	 * customer consented to instead of re-pricing against whatever promo is running
369	 * when they get back (mirrors `chargeCents` in lib/resize.ts applyResize and
370	 * lib/disk-expand.ts applyDiskExpand). The wallet path omits it and pays the
